    "slide4": "Old narration frames water leaving as a lost resource; corrected draft says some excess water needs a safe route away.",
    "slide6": "Old A-frame claims include unsupported tracing rates and assurances; corrected draft limits it to equal-height observations and requires site assessment before earthworks.",
