    "slide16": "Sketch remains marked not to scale until distances have been checked.",
    "slide18": "Khakibos/blackjack presence alone does not diagnose compaction.",
    "slides20-21": "Field walk is conditional on safety; A-frame is observation, not earthworks design or approval."
  },
